// Stable SemIndex encoding has one canonical codec family. Raw helpers retain
// source order/nulls/duplicates; inspect boundaries build Foundation StatusValue
// directly rather than serialize and reparse a recursive checked fact graph.

// json_instance json_output json_definition_fact json_output_payload
// json_optional_str json_strings json_string_array json_optional_strings
// json_trust_decision json_package_authority json_string_map json_service
// json_services json_environment json_environments json_package_output
// json_package_outputs json_config_facts json_inline_configs json_members
// package_facts_json workspace_overlay_policy_json BTreeMap wire order is
// retained by sorting keys once in the canonical codecs; package
// digests/redaction/authority facts remain owned by PackageModel.

// json_span json_view_provenance json_callable_unavailable
// json_callable_signature json_kind json_def json_trait_contract json_ref
// json_compiler_fact json_call json_effect json_arithmetic json_member_kind
// json_origin json_member json_state_graph

// Impl SemIndex SemIndex.to_json SemIndex.to_status_envelope
// SemIndex.to_status_envelope_with_expand SemIndex.to_status_envelope_inner The
// complete implementations live in Codec/Envelope.jet. Its status_payload_fields is
// the private inner assembly, with expansion appended only by the expanded boundary;
// the original fifteen base fields stay ordered.

// Impl TypeDossier TypeDossier.to_status_envelope TypeDossier.to_json
// TypeDossier.render_text Full JSON/text dossier implementation lives in
// Codec/Dossier.jet, including nominal base, trait/failure contracts, effects,
// states, references and bypasses. bypass_kind_text json_bypass origin_text

// convert_defs contract_metadata find_declaration trait_contracts_for_owner
// collect_trait_contracts member_signatures callable_signature convert_refs
// convert_kind convert_view_provenance Convert owns the entire final function
// through1808, including Range and provenance.mutable from the next placement.
// Checked registration and loaded source rows replace ProgramBundle; no
// duplicate AST/name-ledger producer.
